# ============================================================
# Vox Showtimes Monitor - film watchlist
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `movies.conf` and edit it.
#   cp movies.conf.example movies.conf
#
# ONE FILM PER LINE, in this format:
#   slug|Display Name|Cinema Name|Full Vox movie URL
#
# - slug: short, URL-safe id. It becomes the film's public
#   push topic (voxwatch-<slug>) that website visitors
#   subscribe to, so pick something stable.
# - Cinema name must match the heading on the movie page
#   exactly (the monitor looks for that section).
#
# Lines starting with # and empty lines are ignored.
# ============================================================

the-odyssey|The Odyssey|City Centre Almaza|https://egy.voxcinemas.com/movies/the-odyssey
